# Copy this file to `.env.local` (same directory) and fill in the value.
# `pnpm --filter @linen/kernel dev` loads .env.local automatically, and it
# is gitignored so the value never gets committed.
#
# Google OAuth Web-application client id — the SAME value as the client's
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in apps/web/.env.local. It is public (it ships to
# the browser), so it is not a secret; it just must match on both sides.
#
# Get it from Google Cloud Console:
#   APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create Credentials -> OAuth client ID
#   Application type: Web application
#   Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173
# Then copy the "Client ID" (ends in .apps.googleusercontent.com) here.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
